@startuml text-to-speech
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #888
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

title Text-to-Speech: Phát thuyết minh gian hàng

actor User
participant "CommentaryPlayer\n(.tsx)" as UI
participant "useCommentary\n(React Query hook)" as Hook
participant "PublicStores\nController" as API
participant "PublicStores\nService" as Svc
database "Postgres" as DB
participant "Web Speech API\n(SpeechSynthesis)" as TTS

User -> UI : Click ▶ (play)
UI -> Hook : useCommentary(storeId, lang)

note right of Hook
  staleTime 30s
  cache theo (storeId, lang)
end note

Hook -> API : GET /stores/{storeId}/commentary?lang={lang}
API -> Svc : getCommentary(storeId, lang)
Svc -> DB : query Commentary + CommentaryTranslation
DB --> Svc : translatedText, audioUrl, pipelineStatus
Svc --> API : { translatedText, audioUrl, status }
API --> Hook : response
Hook --> UI : data

UI -> TTS : speakText(translatedText)
note right of TTS
  TTS chạy 100% trên client
  (không gọi backend TTS)
end note
TTS --> User : 🔊 phát âm thanh

@enduml
